{
  "brand": "Blum",
  "website": "https://www.blum.com",
  "notes": "LEGRABOX drawers N, M and K, inner drawers M and K (pp. 204-205, 208-209) and high fronted pull-outs C and F for LEGRABOX pure (pp. 210-211, 216-217) from the Blum Catalogue and technical manual 2024/2025, printed pages 198-207 (order information and planning) and 248. Cut sizes are Blum's for 16 mm chipboard bases and backs. The catalogue lists N only for NL 400-550. Cabinet profile screw positions (p.248) are along the profile, but their height on the side is not printed on these pages, so the side drilling is not recorded yet. The drawer system rows (blum.legrabox.n/m/k) carry the planning numbers; their article is the system name, not an orderable part. Not verified by a person. C and F: base_above_datum 24.4 and the front hole chains (C 51/+32/+96, F 51/+32/+96/+32/+32) are read from the drawings; F's front takes an M bracket pair below a C pair. Inner drawers take the M or K side sets and have a steel front piece, no front holes; their base height above the datum is taken from the M/K drawer drawings (the inner drawer pages do not print it).",
